, 			{
				"box" : 				{
					"maxclass" : "comment",
					"text" : "An example of using Litter objects to generate MIDI “counterpoint”. Pitches are selected with 1\/f distribution, entry times by an exponential distribution. Notice the difference in character from the other “Counterpoint exercises.” This one is my favorite.",
